      "BriefDescription": "We are currently seeking an Indirect Lending Credit Officer to join our organization. As the Indirect Lending Credit Officer, you will be responsible for evaluating loan quality by fully underwriting, identifying, assessing, and reporting credit risks in all indirect consumer loan types in accordance with credit union policy and guidelines. You will work with dealerships to clear underwriting conditions and/or stipulations while understanding required documentation for making a well-educated underwriting decision. You will ensure that the credit union’s members and auto dealerships are provided a market-leading service relationship with an emphasis on both credit quality and increasing market share by enhancing dealer relationships and providing best-in-class service.",
